            "en": "Oxidative-stress/mitochondrial-dysfunction mechanisms: DRP1–FIS1 inhibition improved energetic failure and oxidative stress in 5XFAD mice, linking abnormal dynamics with these processes. [R21](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5814200/)"
