              "en": "Furthermore, the expression of PGC1A, encoding peroxisome proliferator-activated receptor gamma coactivator 1-alpha, a transcriptional coactivator and central inducer of mitochondrial biogenesis, was also increased in PALB2 knockdown cells, supporting a role for PALB2 in mitochondrial biogenesis.",
