          "en": "**Limitations:** FAD mutations are strong causal evidence in humans; common-variant and mouse/iPSC findings are largely associative or model-based. Some records (e.g., APP p.V742L in small-vessel disease, PMID 41592617; ECHDC3, PMID 33419465) are not specific to amyloid causality."
