        "boundary_en": "Credit a coherent range of histological, synaptic/neuronal and functional phenotypes. Do not require every cognitive subtype or exact Braak stage. Keep patient correlations distinct from animal intervention evidence; neither a one-to-one tangle–neuron-death relationship nor toxicity of all tau phosphorylation is established."
