          "en": "**Direct answer:** The neuroinflammation hypothesis of AD is linked to several immune signaling pathways, most consistently microglial TREM2–TYROBP signaling, the CD33/SPI1–PU.1 axis, complement (C1q/C3), cytokine–JAK/STAT and NF-κB signaling, and chemokine/cytokine networks (IL-34, CX3CR1, TNF/TNFR2, IL-1β, IFN-γ)."
